      "input": "我的老师是陈老师，我们都很喜欢她。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-11e351a94af9204a"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "我妈妈是北京人，她喜欢吃面条和饺子。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-0bee41504f87d636"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "我有三个中国朋友，王小云、宋华和陆雨平。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-ef23bf3cb038cc39"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "我爸爸是律师，我妈妈是工程师，我哥哥是经理。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-80725cf32b4c9885"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "我们家一共有五口人，爸爸、妈妈、哥哥和我，还有约翰（John）。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-872c9604d392c72b"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "您要什么？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-64e9ac6b5d221c60"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他学什么？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-aa2e51f22f2b2f12"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "她学什么？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-be81f2ea3bdea328"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "她姓陆。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-d46578fe7fc8ba62"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他也姓马。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-3ac22ed851fa1318"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "她也很累。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-18e28a2339872e96"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "林娜也很高兴。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-1cfbafc227a21c17"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "这张照片很有意思。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-f83b5820507e3e7c"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他们有两个孩子，都很漂亮。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-4e10a72097b2309b"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他也不困。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-4225260d7aead3ea"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "她困吗？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-e0f6db4806cea072"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "你们最近忙吗？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-f8b080da2036d992"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他是Juan吗？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-f98768bb0cc3aef6"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "你们怎么样？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-fabd70d8dc7c6721"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他不忙。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-ec33f67613f2c910"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "老师不忙。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-c3f7df1abc8c5fb6"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他学做饭。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-c358d4611626e471"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他今年七岁。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-8551dc51c02602c7"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他是秘鲁人。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-aaaa948989c2c9ec"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "他是Juan。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-6831b0d4449d0edd"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "林娜，你们家有几口人？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-35b5f11dfacef732"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "马马虎虎。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-2327ca3bcdbaefd6"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "她学画画。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-ac25d2a8af3fe209"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "你们学习中文。",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-0a3721928d6f00d4"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
    {
      "input": "这是谁？",
      "entryIds": [
        "PH-dc26f46b796d85d5"
      ],
      "kind": "sentence",
      "status": "not_requested"
    },
